004156.542 | DEBUG    | UI   | BUILDER    | oaGuiElements.buttons.button_toggler.button_toggler | 📜📑💻 [CONFIG] Raw config received: {'type': '_GuiButtonToggler', 'AES70': 'OcaSwitch', 'handler': 'set_averaging', 'layout': {'height': 50, 'alpha': 0.9, 'max_cols': 5, 'width': 50, 'stretch': 'width', 'font': 10}, 'style': {'active_text_color': '#1a1a1a', 'text_color': '#888888', 'active_font_style': 'bold', 'active_font_size': None, 'inactive_font_style': 'normal', 'inactive_font_size': None, 'active_color': '#FF9900', 'active_bg_color': '#000000', 'bg_color': '#2b2b2b', 'glow_intensity': 1.944}, 'options': {'0': {'label_active': 'Off', 'label_inactive': 'Off', 'description': 'Just a raw, single sweep. Great for seeing fast changes and fleeting events, but the noise floor is high and the trace is very jittery.', 'value': '0', 'units': 'count', 'selected': True}, '5': {'label_active': 'Light Filter', 'label_inactive': 'Light Filter', 'description': "A very mild smoothing of the signal, removing some of the jitter. It's like putting a slight damper on the noise, making the trace a little easier to read.", 'value': '5', 'units': 'count', 'selected': False}, '10': {'label_active': 'Getting Clear', 'label_inactive': 'Getting Clear', 'description': 'The trace becomes noticeably less fuzzy. The random spikes of the noise floor start to settle down, revealing more consistent signals.', 'value': '10', 'units': 'count', 'selected': False}, '25': {'label_active': 'The Sweet Spot', 'label_inactive': 'The Sweet Spot', 'description': 'A good balance of noise reduction and display speed. The noise floor is clean, and low-level, stable signals are clearly visible.', 'value': '25', 'units': 'count', 'selected': False}, '50': {'label_active': 'Steady Hands', 'label_inactive': 'Steady Hands', 'description': "The noise floor is now very stable and appears as a thin line. You're only seeing the most consistent signals and cutting out most of the random interference.", 'value': '50', 'units': 'count', 'selected': False}, '75': {'label_active': 'Deep Dive', 'label_inactive': 'Deep Dive', 'description': "This setting is for serious analysis. It's a highly stable trace that filters out a large portion of the ambient RF noise, allowing for precise measurements of continuous signals.", 'value': '75', 'units': 'count', 'selected': False}, '100': {'label_active': 'Scientific Grade', 'label_inactive': 'Scientific Grade', 'description': 'For when only the cleanest signal will do. This high level of averaging provides a virtually noise-free display, perfect for scientific or very low-level signal detection.', 'value': '100', 'units': 'count', 'selected': False}, '200': {'label_active': 'Crystal Clear', 'label_inactive': 'Crystal Clear', 'description': 'A deep and thorough look at the spectrum. All but the most stable signals are averaged out, offering a truly pristine view of the fundamental RF environment.', 'value': '200', 'units': 'count', 'selected': False}, '500': {'label_active': 'The Observer', 'label_inactive': 'The Observer', 'description': 'An incredibly slow and deliberate pace. This is for long-term monitoring, allowing you to see the overall shape of the spectrum with almost all noise removed.', 'value': '500', 'units': 'count', 'selected': False}, '1000': {'label_active': 'Meditative Mode', 'label_inactive': 'Meditative Mode', 'description': 'For the patient and the meticulous. This is the ultimate level of noise reduction, yielding an exceptionally smooth and stable trace for the most demanding analysis.', 'value': '1000', 'units': 'count', 'selected': False}, 'UNSELECTED': {'value': 'NONE', 'label_active': 'None Selected', 'label_inactive': 'None Selected', 'description': 'No averaging option is currently selected.', 'units': '', 'selected': False}}, 'yak_handler': {'enable': True, 'yak_type': 'set', 'sub_path': 'Trace', 'command': 'Set_Averaging', 'input_name': 'count_int', 'converter': 'int'}, 'geometry': {'width': 126}, 'active_text_color': '